# Cloudflare Pages response headers (Astro copies public/ verbatim into
# dist/, and Pages reads _headers from the output directory).
# Clickjacking hardening: only same-origin framing is allowed — the world
# demo's iframes are same-origin, so they keep working. Mirrors the header
# block in deploy/Caddyfile for the compose/Caddy deployment path.
/*
  X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN
  Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors 'self'
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin